#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:3
msgid "Extension Capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:5
msgid ""
"The operations that Zed extensions are able to perform are governed by a "
"capability system."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:7
msgid "Restricting capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:9
msgid ""
"As a user, you have the option of restricting the capabilities that are "
"granted to extensions."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:11
msgid "This is controlled via the `granted_extension_capabilities` setting."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:13
msgid ""
"Restricting or removing a capability will cause an error to be returned when "
"an extension attempts to call the corresponding extension API without "
"sufficient capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:15
msgid ""
"For example, to restrict downloads to files from GitHub, set `host` for the "
"`download_file` capability:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:28
msgid ""
"If you don't want extensions to be able to perform _any_ capabilities, you "
"can remove all granted capabilities:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:32
msgid "\"granted_extension_capabilities\""
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:36
msgid ""
"Note that this will likely make many extensions non-functional, at least in "
"their default configuration."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:38
msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:40
msgid "`process:exec`"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:42
msgid ""
"The `process:exec` capability grants extensions the ability to invoke "
"commands using [`zed_extension_api::process::Command`](https://docs.rs/"
"zed_extension_api/latest/zed_extension_api/process/struct.Command.html)."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:44 src/extensions/capabilities.md:62
#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:86
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:46
msgid "To allow any command to be executed with any arguments:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:48
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"process:exec\", command = \"*\", args = [\"**\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:52
msgid ""
"To allow a specific command (e.g., `gem`) to be executed with any arguments:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:54
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"process:exec\", command = \"gem\", args = [\"**\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:58
msgid "`download_file`"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:60
msgid ""
"The `download_file` capability grants extensions the ability to download "
"files using [`zed_extension_api::download_file`](https://docs.rs/"
"zed_extension_api/latest/zed_extension_api/fn.download_file.html)."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:64
msgid "To allow any file to be downloaded:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:66
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"download_file\", host = \"*\", path = [\"**\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:70
msgid "To allow any file to be downloaded from `github.com`:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:72
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"download_file\", host = \"github.com\", path = [\"**\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:76
msgid "To allow any file to be downloaded from a specific GitHub repository:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:78
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"download_file\", host = \"github.com\", path = [\"zed-"
"industries\", \"zed\", \"**\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:82
msgid "`npm:install`"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:84
msgid ""
"The `npm:install` capability grants extensions the ability to install npm "
"packages using [`zed_extension_api::npm_install_package`](https://docs.rs/"
"zed_extension_api/latest/zed_extension_api/fn.npm_install_package.html)."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:88
msgid "To allow any npm package to be installed:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:90
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"npm:install\", package = \"*\" }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:94
msgid "To allow a specific npm package (e.g., `typescript`) to be installed:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/capabilities.md:96
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"{ kind = \"npm:install\", package = \"typescript\" }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
